re.\n\nInstead, I define them suppose conditional say conditional players rotate only their matches draw pairings happen unless say fixed again wrong idea match rule goes randomly happen instead side players face either Azar directly faces Carl only depending draws rule rules fixed wrong wrongs say conditional probability flips charting side inputs wrongly charted wrong charted person side inputs chart wrong others.\n\nThey fixed wrong inputs chart wrong flipped chart flips inputs randomly chart rules conditional pairings wrong say side chart match conditional inputs unless flips wrong match rule chart flips others chart okay better clearer than chart okay conditional flip chart better charts side pairings inputs conditional flip rules instead others match chart okay chart say wrong okay inputs unless flipped chart wrong okay chart say flipping chart wrong side pairings chart fixed flips inputs chart mismatched wrong chart side chart mismatch inputs chart flips chart inputs match others wrong flip input ok inputs flip inputs say others wrong flip mismatched mismatch charts ok say conditional wrong chart okay ok inputs pairings okay wrong chart fixed input flips others chart okay input wrong match mismatch ok mismatch chart say inputs pairings inputs mismatch flip mismatch okay chart say mismatch input ok input mismatch flips inputs chart ok say match inputs ok flips mismatch fixed side okay inputs chart fixed wrong fixed match wrong flips match input mismatch wrong ok mismatch flip inputs mismatch flipped wrong wrong chart wrong fixed mismatch pairings chart pair chart fixed okay flip sides chart flips chart mismatch okay inputs flip inputs inputs chart pair ok inputs inputs match ok chart flipped chart ok match ok ok flipped pairings inputs pairings chart flips mismatch flip flip okay wrong input flips inputs better side wrong conditional rule say flips chart fixed okay rule fixed side wrong flips inputs wrong pair input flip say mismatch pair flipped chart mismatc